# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: isIdentifiedBy is functional, so two distinct
# identifications for one object contradict (VDI 3682 Part 2, Fig. 3).
@prefix vdi3682: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg05> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682/2.0.0> .
ex:Obj vdi3682:isIdentifiedBy ex:ID1 , ex:ID2 .
ex:ID1 a vdi3682:Identification .
ex:ID2 a vdi3682:Identification .
ex:ID1 owl:differentFrom ex:ID2 .
